  <item>
    <title>010 反向奥德赛：希腊神话与罗马建国</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6875faa293fd2d72b8477b6d</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6875faa293fd2d72b8477b6d</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 15 Jul 2025 07:31:03 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>反向奥德赛：希腊神话与罗马建国 《埃涅阿斯纪》一部罗马建国的宏大史诗，竟是对《荷马史诗》的精巧“复刻”。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/241739618" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/241739618"><span>📺视频版</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575d69a56a6a6909cb730b37" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575d69a56a6a6909cb730b37"><span>📕艾尔文Alwyn</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 从特洛伊到罗马，抄袭？复刻？致敬？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="75">01:15</a> 狄多之死，突然有点讨厌丘比特了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">03:24</a> 火神铸盾🛡️，算是旧瓶装新酒？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="288">04:48</a> 神话也有赞助商，也太硬了。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a> 神话中的罗马史，神学叠buff。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="518">08:38</a> 维纳斯的荣耀「回宫」，娱乐一下。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="638">10:38</a> 神要和你生孩子，贞女注定都是要当妈的。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 爱神也偷情，但罗马人引以为傲。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="846">14:06</a> 宙斯的情人宇宙，木星的每一刻都卫星，都是一段宙斯化身、诱拐的八卦恋情。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fu6xM7zUdXcAgbVezXs-cVtE1XcM.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="377">06:17</a> 神话中的罗马史</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>神话中的罗马建国史，是众神通过血缘不断强化王族血脉的“正名”之路。制图by </span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/241739618" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/241739618"><span>@艾尔文Alwyn</span></a><span> 未经授权请勿转载</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvEi--CQJf89B9OYTqlr9cW6Bq3c.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="204">03:24</a> 火神铸盾🛡️</span></blockquote><span></span><blockquote><span>两个故事里都有请火神铸造盾牌的故事，阿喀琉斯之盾上描绘的的是世间万物，而埃涅阿斯的盾牌上则是罗马帝国未来的辉煌历程。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6771268a15a5fd520e713669/lmKvFuwFyP4JR9ZyPl8ltPGUTIXK.m4a" length="15439305" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:15:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgf9e_irsJLChgb-D38g_qXe-SVO.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>009 《荷马史诗》衍生剧？从特洛伊到罗马。</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6845d5fb6dbe9284e76dfad5</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6845d5fb6dbe9284e76dfad5</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 09 Jun 2025 08:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>当奥德修斯率领希腊战士从木马腹中跃出，冲天的火光照亮了特洛伊最后的夜晚，这座昔日傲然屹立的城池，终于在血与火中迎来了史诗般的终章。</span></p><span></span><p><span>但命运的织机从未停歇——正如焦土中悄然萌发的新芽终将破土而出，一位肩负神圣使命的王子正穿行于燃烧的街巷之间。他将带领残存的特洛伊人，踏上一段属于自己的“奥德赛”。</span></p><span></span><p><span>埃涅阿斯，这位曾在荷马笔下险些被阿喀琉斯终结的配角，海神波塞冬口中被命运选中、必须存活的王子，如今将开启属于自己的史诗：那颗从特洛伊灰烬中带走的新芽，终将在意大利的土地上生根发芽，成长为一个更加伟大的文明——罗马。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期的主题是：罗马史诗神话《埃涅阿斯纪》。这集先开个头，下期继续。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575d69a56a6a6909cb730b37" data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/575d69a56a6a6909cb730b37"><span>📕小红书</span></a><span> &nbsp;</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/241739618" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/241739618"><span>📺Bilibili</span></a></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 特洛伊的终章</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="56">00:56</a> 模仿《荷马史诗》写成的《埃涅阿斯纪》</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="149">02:29</a> 波塞冬在特洛伊战场救下宙斯的血脉，留下希望的种子。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="406">06:46</a> “欧洲始皇”奥古斯都，罗马帝国的开国皇帝屋大维，资助诗人创作罗马史诗。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="596">09:56</a> 反向奥德赛：与荷马史诗走向相反的英雄之旅……</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="835">13:55</a> 一个小彩蛋...</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkYseNTerUdAOm9xcu_23GRvFL3x.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>随着特洛伊的陨落，埃涅阿斯背着父亲、带着妻子和儿子逃离特洛伊……</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg-M0LyZ3p7ABCahi3KK3oNWIjtX.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>埃涅阿斯到达迦太基，向女王狄多讲述特洛伊的遭遇。</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6771268a15a5fd520e713669/lmMXpi0282Eh9PDztfvuisGvq8T7.m4a" length="14881619" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:15:20</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ltCM8wc05q70nLOvYQE48u0a0Guv.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>008 文化压缩包：奥德赛</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/681e57a824f8559346cfde2c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">681e57a824f8559346cfde2c</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 10 May 2025 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>你肯定听过“奥德赛”这个词。</span></p><span></span><p><span>2001：太空漫游 —— 奥德赛！</span></p><span></span><p><span>刺客信条：奥德赛！</span></p><span></span><p><span>超级马里奥奥德赛！</span></p><span></span><p><span>奥德赛——是不是一听就有种神秘又壮阔的感觉？他似乎代表着“漫游”与“探险”，但又好像……在背后藏着更大的故事。</span></p><span></span><p><span>“奥德赛”到底代表什么？今天我们就来把这个词，彻彻底底讲明白！</span></p><span></span><p><span>视频版本在：</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yFVXzgEBX/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1yFVXzgEBX/"><span>📺小电视</span></a><span> 或各平台搜索 @艾尔文Alwyn</span></p><span></span><p><span>内容提要：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 何为奥德赛</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 特洛伊木马</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="184">03:04</a> 波塞冬的复仇</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="293">04:53</a> 风神的帮助</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="389">06:29</a> 女巫与先知亡灵</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="549">09:09</a> 海妖塞壬</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> 女神美不美</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">12:47</a> 爱的守候</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="874">14:34</a> 结语：奥德赛</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnL4IvHlKKzG0D5K-uqtToLWJW44.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 《奥德赛》是《荷马史诗》的第二部分，讲述了特洛伊战争之后，伊萨卡的国王奥德修斯返回故乡的艰险旅程。物理的漂泊、心理的成长，成为后续西方文学“英雄之旅”的经典模版。</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh-jhjmDQ5HGrWlRnqZtdHyhtumx.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="635">10:35</a> 卡吕普索是泰坦神阿特拉斯的后代，泰坦神被宙斯推翻后，阿特拉斯被罚托起天穹，卡吕普索也被迫孤独地生活在偏远的岛屿上。她爱上了漂流到岛上的奥德修斯，许诺赋予他永生并强留了他七年。但最终，在雅典娜的斡旋、宙斯的干预下，被迫让奥德修斯离去。这幅作品描述了神的使者赫尔墨斯向卡吕普索传递神谕，另其释放奥德修斯的场景。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6771268a15a5fd520e713669/liZAkUMUnz8JlbMAg3ZJcshgtwEE.m4a" length="15292489" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:15:45</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgVgdNeYO_KdmISyjCXkq0t-frpu.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>007 文化压缩包：特洛伊与阿喀琉斯</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/680f5e877a449ae858342887</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">680f5e877a449ae858342887</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Apr 2025 11:00:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>“特洛伊木马”、“阿喀琉斯之踵”……你可能都不陌生，这些词就像一个个文化压缩包，背后蕴藏着惊心动魄的故事、与充满哲理的启发。“特洛伊”到底是一个真实存在过的地方，还是像亚特兰蒂斯一样的传说？这场战争到底是因为海伦之美，还是背后藏着别的地缘政治目的？</span></p><p><span>今天就来聊聊这个充满悬念和想象的词：特洛伊（Troy）。</span></p><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uzL2zTEVN/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1uzL2zTEVN/"><span>📺视频版</span></a></p><p><span>#希腊神话 #特洛伊 #特洛伊木马 #阿喀琉斯 #阿喀琉斯之踵 #亚历山大</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开篇</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 荷马史诗</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="126">02:06</a> 帕里斯的审判</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="190">03:10</a> 英文名小知识：亚历山大</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="381">06:21</a> 女装大佬的故事</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="384">06:24</a> 阿喀琉斯之怒</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">08:33</a> 河神的愤怒与诸神的混战</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="677">11:17</a> 阿喀琉斯之踵</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="760">12:40</a> 特洛伊</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg93jkFiDkaRszrZLbepZj0zA3xq.jpg"></figure><blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="28">00:28</a> 荷马史诗，口口相传的希腊神话故事。</span></p></blockquote><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fox1GTEhNm4MNuzjmSIaLo2rQmTc.jpg"></figure><blockquote><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="513">08:33</a> 阿喀琉斯的愤怒，也激怒了河神，并引发了诸神的混战！雅典娜、赫拉、波塞冬……纷纷下场。</span></p></blockquote>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6771268a15a5fd520e713669/lvZuOJVS1xrbAa72O_3tUP1BB9vR.m4a" length="13398302" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:13:48</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkOuM3EmRGG6YIGIVAHepzm1kpp1.png"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
