    <pubDate>Thu, 06 Feb 2025 09:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>Bonjour</span></strong><span>，这一期</span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/iPJy9Xfo/" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/iPJy9Xfo/"><span>@艾尔文Alwyn</span></a><span> 和 </span><a href="https://v.douyin.com/iPJygKeK/" data-url="https://v.douyin.com/iPJygKeK/"><span>@Sophie不是公主</span></a><span> 一起来跟大家聊希腊神话故事里的</span><strong><span>海王</span></strong><span>！</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家在视频平台观看视频版（</span><a href="https://space.bilibili.com/241739618" data-url="https://space.bilibili.com/241739618"><span>@艾尔文Alwyn</span></a><span> ），会有精美的古典美术作品、照片和视频素材。</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="140">02:20</a> 海王的身世</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 「抽签」定王位！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="623">10:23</a> 亚特兰蒂斯</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="701">11:41</a> 海王的爱情</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="902">15:02</a> 海洋仙女忒提斯的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1043">17:23</a> &nbsp;海后安菲特里忒</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1186">19:46</a> 天马是海王的儿子？！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1241">20:41</a> 波塞冬与马</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1452">24:12</a> 一个谐音梗冷笑话，哈哈</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1470">24:30</a> 海王神庙的遗迹</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1539">25:39</a> 海王的其他身份</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqHeeFEp-qFyilGX7U_7hRgZBymH.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>海王波塞冬与妻子安菲特里忒</span></blockquote><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lhAMmF6zOB85XF_vIaz3kE8AIsBL.jpeg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>意大利罗马许愿池中的雕塑人物主要与海洋和水神相关包括了正中的海王</span><strong><span>尼普顿</span></strong><span>、水神特里同等。</span></blockquote>]]></description>
