    <guid isPermaLink="false">6784b4d11bf3f0ab2bc5d03a</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 13 Jan 2025 11:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>我和@Sophie不是公主 继续来跟大家分享「离谱的希腊神话」。这次在分享故事的同时也来看看有哪些神祇或者英雄的名字适合来做英文名，希望大家感兴趣。</span></p><span></span><p><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ATrYYkEqh/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1ATrYYkEqh/"><span>📺视频版-1</span></a><span> </span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV189cyeBEtn/" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV189cyeBEtn/"><span>📺视频版-2</span></a></p><span></span><p><span>视频版（分为了上下两集）会配有各个神话故事、人物的经典古典美术作品供大家欣赏，也许能让您有一些直观的感受，也推荐给大家。</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhb378SlDcOVdI4mejiNWAnGS_ek.jpg"></figure><span></span><blockquote><span>古典油画作品《沉睡的Endymion》，1756年 · 尼古拉斯·盖·布雷内特；Endymion是本期神话故事「许愿须谨慎」的男主角之一。</span></blockquote><span></span><p><strong><span>本期节目目录</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 开头</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="20">00:20</a> 起英文名的小Tips by @Sophie不是公主</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="338">05:38</a> 太阳神 Apollo和化作月桂树的Daphne</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="520">08:40</a> &nbsp;大战天蝎座的猎户座Orion</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 象征春天与新生的Chloe</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="714">11:54</a> 特洛伊王子Hector</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="828">13:48</a> 掌管光明与智辉的泰坦女神Phoebe</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="890">14:50</a> 美少年Adonis</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="997">16:37</a> 奥德修斯的妻子Penelope</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1115">18:35</a> 一系列「许愿须谨慎」的故事 Endymion Selene Helene Eos</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1506">25:06</a> 「她」竟然叫雅典娜？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1595">26:35</a> &nbsp;英雄忒修斯Theseus</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1688">28:08</a> 偷情被围观的战神Ares</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1793">29:53</a> 风神Zephyr</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1860">31:00</a> 盗贼之神Hermes</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1959">32:39</a> 彩虹女神Iris</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2049">34:09</a> 结尾&amp;预告</span></p>]]></description>
